- [ ] Integration test file `DEVKIT{XXXX}.cs` created in `TestAnalyzers\`
- [ ] Documentation `DEVKIT{XXXX}.md` created
- [ ] `ANALYZERS_ROADMAP.md` updated
- [ ] Request anh Phước to test in Visual Studio
